@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health


### Buscar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

###Buscar fatura pelo identificados
GET {{host}}/api/invoice/184

### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

###Altera fatura

PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/181
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

###Deletar faturas

DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/185